Description: KERI managed Wireguard
 KERIGuard provides KERI-based identity and access management for
 Wireguard VPN networks. This package includes:
 .
  * Guardian service for managing Wireguard configuration
  * Sentinel service for monitoring KERI events
  * kg and kg-sentinel CLI utilities
